<title>USA: ADC signs distribution pact in China.</title>
<headline>ADC signs distribution pact in China.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADC Telecommunications Inc said Wednesday it signed a distribution agreement under which Nanjing Telecommunications Equipment Factory will market and sell ADC's fiber-optic cabling systems throughout China.</p>
<p>The first phase of the multi-phase agreement establishes Nanjing Telecommunications as a distributor in China of ADC's FL2000 fiber panel products.</p>
<p>Other phases will involve assembly and manufacturing of such products in China using ADC's technology and design.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
